{
  "key": 17420,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00000",
      "en_US": "Kay & Tia"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "You had fun battling us, right?\r",
        "So how about we exchange phone\n",
        "numbers, and that way if we want to\f",
        "battle again, we can just give each\f",
        "other a call? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "All right, now you’ve got our number\n",
        "and we have yours."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00003",
      "en_US": "Oh? But... Oh well."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you decide you wanted to trade\n",
        "numbers after all? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "All right, here you go!\n",
        "It’s an Oval Stone.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh?\n",
        "Wait, aren’t you nearby?\r",
        "Do you just really like talking on the\n",
        "phone or something? What an odd hobby."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Our {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} is much stronger now!\r",
        "We were battling a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\n",
        "recently and it was over before we\f",
        "knew it!\r",
        "Oh yeah, by the way, this is Tia."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Our {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} is much stronger now!\r",
        "We were battling a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\n",
        "recently and it was over before we\f",
        "knew it!\r",
        "Oh yeah, by the way, this is Kay."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Earlier we saw a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} on\n",
        "Route 15. Didn’t we, Tia?\r",
        "Yeah, then suddenly a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\n",
        "came out of nowhere. Didn’t it, Kay?\r",
        "Yeah, and we were so surprised we just\n",
        "ran away. Didn’t we, Tia?\r",
        "I keep thinking about it, Kay, and\n",
        "I think that since we have Pokémon,\f",
        "we should have just battled, right?\r",
        "Is it hard to tell who’s who when you’re\n",
        "talking to both of us on the phone?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "We should have another battle, just\n",
        "the three of us.\r",
        "We’re on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so come on\n",
        "over when you get the chance."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Didn’t we make plans to have\n",
        "another battle?\r",
        "We’re waiting on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so\n",
        "don’t forget, OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, since we’re on the phone, how\n",
        "about we give you a quiz?\r",
        "...\r",
        "So, who’s speaking right now? Kay or\n",
        "Tia?\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\f",
        "...\f",
        "...\f",
        "The correct answer is...\r",
        "Eleanor from the Pokémon Fan club,\n",
        "who’s standing next to the twins!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, Tia found an Oval Stone.\r",
        "We’ll give it to you if you come find us\n",
        "on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. Got it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0679_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "We’re waiting on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\n",
        "We’ll give you an Oval Stone..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
